### Cart, checkout and orders from IntelliJ. Run "Register a shop owner" (or log in) first.
### Dev seed: delivery ₹500, free above ₹5,000, minimum order ₹1,000, coupons SAVE5 and FLAT100.

### Register a shop owner (change the mobile number if it is taken)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"fullName": "Test Kirana", "phone": "9000000099", "password": "secret123"}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); client.global.set("userId", response.body.user.id); %}

### Find a product id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/thums-up-750ml-pet

> {% client.global.set("productId", response.body.id); %}

### Price a cart: slab prices, coupon, delivery, minimum order, stock and credit (changes nothing)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/checkout/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 10}], "couponCode": "SAVE5"}

### Save a delivery address (the first one becomes the default)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/me/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"label": "Shop", "fullName": "Test Kirana", "phone": "9000000099", "addressLine1": "12 Main Road", "city": "Hyderabad", "pincode": "500001"}

> {% client.global.set("addressId", response.body.id); %}

### My addresses
GET http://localhost:8080/api/me/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Place a cash-on-delivery order. expectedTotal = the quote's total; if prices changed you get 409.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 10}], "couponCode": "SAVE5", "addressId": "{{addressId}}", "paymentMethod": "COD", "expectedTotal": 4091}

### For UPI: upload the screenshot first, then send its reference as paymentScreenshot with paymentMethod "UPI".
POST http://localhost:8080/api/me/payment-screenshots
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="paid.jpg"

< ./paid.jpg
--boundary--

### My orders
GET http://localhost:8080/api/me/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---- Admin ----

### Login as admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"identifier": "admin@smartretail.local", "password": "Admin@12345"}

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Give the shop owner ₹25,000 credit (0 turns credit off)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/shops/credit
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId": "{{userId}}", "shopName": "Test Kirana", "creditLimit": 25000}

### Shops with credit and what they owe
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/shops
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Coupons
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create a coupon (PERCENTAGE or FIXED)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code": "DIWALI10", "description": "10% off, up to ₹1,000", "discountType": "PERCENTAGE", "discountValue": 10, "minOrderValue": 3000, "maxDiscount": 1000, "usageLimit": 200}
